{%- comment -%}
  Prints the last day (YYYY-MM-DD) after which an experience counts as past, or
  nothing when it never moves to past on its own. Same rule as
  tg-experience-status: end_date, else start_date, except an "ongoing" entry
  with no end date.

  The calendar and the experience page put it in a data-ends attribute, and
  JavaScript compares it with the visitor's date, because Shopify caches
  rendered pages and a date check done only in Liquid can go stale.

  Accepts:
  - entry {Object}: an "experience" metaobject entry
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign raw = entry.status.value | join: ' ' | downcase | strip
  if entry.end_date.value != blank
    echo entry.end_date.value | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
  elsif entry.start_date.value != blank
    unless raw contains 'ongoing'
      echo entry.start_date.value | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
    endunless
  endif
-%}
